{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Operator decision (2026-11-23), design point (a) snapshot eviction with an open file on Windows: option 1 — defer eviction of an in-use entry to a later pass and report it as deferred; the later pass evicts it once closed; reverify_entry reports a corrupt entry it could not move as a failure (not 'discarded'). test_eviction_rename_to_trash_open_reader_survives should then run on Windows."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795455259602227001,"uuid":"8ddd98e3-056c-4980-925f-0a1deb93fae5"}